#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "You do not have permission for the device of that cluster."
msgstr "Wala kang pahintulot para sa device ng cluster na iyon."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Name: another cluster already uses this name."
msgstr "Pangalan: may isa pang cluster na gumagamit na ng pangalang ito."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not saved: it was changed by someone else since the form was opened, or the write failed. Open it again and repeat the change."
msgstr "Hindi na-save ang cluster: binago ito ng iba mula nang buksan ang form, o nabigo ang pagsulat. Buksan itong muli at ulitin ang pagbabago."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was saved."
msgstr "Na-save ang cluster."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster state was not changed: the write failed. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Hindi nabago ang estado ng cluster: nabigo ang pagsulat. Tingnan ang Cacti log."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster and its cached snapshot were deleted. Its device and graphs were kept. The scheduler was not contacted."
msgstr "Nabura ang cluster at ang naka-cache na snapshot nito. Pinanatili ang device at mga graph nito. Hindi nakipag-ugnayan sa scheduler."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device and its graphs were created."
msgstr "Nagawa ang device at ang mga graph nito."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The device was not created: the cluster already has a device, it was changed by someone else since the page was opened, or Cacti refused it. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Hindi nagawa ang device: may device na ang cluster, binago ito ng iba mula nang buksan ang pahina, o tinanggihan ito ng Cacti. Tingnan ang Cacti log."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was mapped to the device."
msgstr "Nai-map ang cluster sa device."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not mapped: the device does not exist, is not allowed to you, already carries another cluster, or the cluster was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Hindi nai-map ang cluster: hindi umiiral ang device, hindi ito pinahihintulutan sa iyo, may dala nang ibang cluster, o binago ang cluster ng iba mula nang buksan ang pahina."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "Missing graphs were added."
msgstr "Naidagdag ang mga nawawalang graph."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "No graphs were added: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Walang naidagdag na graph: walang device ang cluster, o hindi na umiiral ang device nito."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was not unmapped: it was changed by someone else since the page was opened."
msgstr "Hindi na-unmap ang cluster: binago ito ng iba mula nang buksan ang pahina."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The cluster was unmapped. The device and its graphs were kept."
msgstr "Na-unmap ang cluster. Pinanatili ang device at ang mga graph nito."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were reindexed from the snapshot."
msgstr "Na-reindex ang mga partition mula sa snapshot."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the device is disabled or down, so Cacti skipped its data query."
msgstr "Hindi na-reindex ang mga partition: naka-disable o hindi maabot (down) ang device, kaya nilaktawan ng Cacti ang data query nito."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: Cacti could not run the data query. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Hindi na-reindex ang mga partition: hindi mapatakbo ng Cacti ang data query. Tingnan ang Cacti log."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the HPC Scheduler data query is not installed. Install the templates from the health page."
msgstr "Hindi na-reindex ang mga partition: hindi naka-install ang data query ng HPC Scheduler. I-install ang mga template mula sa pahina ng kalusugan."

#: hpcsched_clusters.php
msgid "The partitions were not reindexed: the cluster has no device, or its device no longer exists."
msgstr "Hindi na-reindex ang mga partition: walang device ang cluster, o hindi na umiiral ang device nito."

#: hpcsched_health.php
msgid "The HPC Scheduler templates are installed."
msgstr "Naka-install ang mga template ng HPC Scheduler."

#: hpcsched_health.php
#, php-format
msgid "The templates were not installed: %s"
msgstr "Hindi na-install ang mga template: %s"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "View ng pagsubaybay"

#: hpcsched_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "Hindi mabasa ang mga obserbasyon. Hilingin sa isang administrator na suriin ang log ng plugin."

#: include/operator.php
msgid "Inspect pending reason families and snapshot freshness on the overview. Escalate credentials, cluster mappings and maintenance policy to an administrator."
msgstr "Suriin ang mga pamilya ng dahilan ng paghihintay at kasariwaan ng snapshot sa pangkalahatang-ideya. I-escalate ang mga kredensyal, mapping ng cluster, at patakaran sa pagpapanatili sa isang administrator."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Name: use 1 to 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, starting with a letter or digit."
msgstr "Pangalan: gumamit ng 1 hanggang 64 na titik, digit, tuldok, gitling, o underscore, na nagsisimula sa titik o digit."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Poller: choose one of the listed pollers."
msgstr "Poller: pumili ng isa sa mga nakalistang poller."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Collection Interval: enter whole seconds from %d to %d."
msgstr "Agwat ng Pangongolekta: maglagay ng buong segundo mula %d hanggang %d."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Transport: choose one of the listed transports."
msgstr "Transport: pumili ng isa sa mga nakalistang transport."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurm.conf: enter an absolute path, or leave it empty to use the poller default."
msgstr "slurm.conf: maglagay ng ganap na path, o iwanang walang laman upang gamitin ang default ng poller."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: this host and port are not on the slurmrestd host list in Settings."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: ang host at port na ito ay wala sa listahan ng slurmrestd host sa Mga Setting."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd URL: enter an https:// URL without user name, query, or fragment; plain http:// is accepted only for a loopback address."
msgstr "slurmrestd URL: maglagay ng https:// URL nang walang user name, query, o fragment; ang plain na http:// ay tinatanggap lamang para sa loopback address."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "slurmrestd User: use at most 64 letters, digits, dots, dashes, or underscores, or leave it empty for a user token."
msgstr "slurmrestd User: gumamit ng hanggang 64 na titik, digit, tuldok, gitling, o underscore, o iwanang walang laman para sa isang user token."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: enter the absolute path of the token file on the poller. The token itself is never entered here."
msgstr "Token File: ilagay ang ganap na path ng token file sa poller. Ang mismong token ay hindi kailanman inilalagay rito."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
msgid "Token File: no token file directories are set yet. Ask a Cacti administrator to set them under Settings, HPC Scheduler."
msgstr "Token File: wala pang itinakdang mga direktoryo ng token file. Hilingin sa isang administrator ng Cacti na itakda ang mga ito sa ilalim ng Mga Setting, HPC Scheduler."

#: lib/ClusterInput.php
#, php-format
msgid "Token File: the file must be inside one of the token file directories set in Settings (%s)."
msgstr "Token File: ang file ay dapat nasa loob ng isa sa mga direktoryo ng token file na itinakda sa Mga Setting (%s)."

